					"value": "Hi manager,\n\nFor case Application_289120003__bf79c49887e4, the application is now on file through jeffrey_henderson. After that, jodi_sexton picked it up for initial follow-up, and then it is now through the first checks with jodi_sexton.\n\nAs of today, the application is now cleared to move ahead, and I started putting together the offer for it. I’ll keep it moving so the next step can go out without delay.\n\nBest,\nMaria"
